          "replacement_utf8": "Read this proof together with [INVARIANT_SUBSET_CORRECTION.md](INVARIANT_SUBSET_CORRECTION.md). The reductive stabilizer argument and every use of Q = I(K,w,σ) are accepted only with that note's corrected general formula: the largest θ-stable subset of the commutant outside P contained in K. The note proves that this is S\\(P∪Σ) for all thirteen classified rows, including empty support. This explicit dependency replaces reliance on the overbroad commutant sentence in the inspected Görtz–He author copy. The proof reconstruction, correction, and separate mathematical audit are AI-assisted; this is not external human peer review or formal proof-assistant certification.",
